This is an original low-poly stylized 3D model. Its proportions were measured
from a Scaniverse Gaussian-splat scan by Saimon888 (Jay / Saimon888oficial),
scan title “Zona Centro”. The model does not include photogrammetry or any
photograph as a texture; colors are original (vertex colors) derived only as a
base tint from the scan’s average/median color, then contrast and warmth were
raised to match the game’s look.

Scan used for measurement only. Please attribute: model for Saimon City / LIFE INC,
based on a scan by Saimon888, CC BY-SA 4.0.
